<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Patch>

  <!-- Optional compatibility. Inert unless Vanilla Furniture Expanded's own
       furniture research is present.

       VFE gates recreation two ways. Anything with a screen in it goes behind
       vanilla's television research - its arcade machine and industrial
       computer on TubeTelevision, its modern computer and spacer radio on
       FlatscreenTelevision - which is exactly where this mod already puts its
       own screens, so those need no patching.

       Powered luxury furniture is different: VFE puts its piano, roulette table
       and lounger behind its own MF_ModernFurniture. The three pieces here of
       that same kind follow them, so a colony running VFE does not get this
       mod's armchair-tier comforts noticeably earlier than VFE's own.

       The test is for that research project rather than for the mod's name.
       PatchOperationFindMod matches on ModLister.HasActiveModWithName, so it
       fires for one exact display name only, and reuploads, translations and
       "(Continued)" forks all carry a different one. More to the point, the
       name is a proxy for what this patch actually needs. If VFE were present
       but had moved or renamed that project, a name gate would fire anyway and
       write a prerequisite that resolves to nothing, which makes all three
       buildings unbuildable. Testing for the def cannot fail either way. Load
       order is not a problem: RimWorld merges every active mod's defs into one
       document and only then applies everyone's patches. -->

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/ResearchProjectDef[defName="MF_ModernFurniture"]</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>

        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="EI_MassageChair"]/researchPrerequisites</xpath>
          <value>
            <researchPrerequisites>
              <li>MF_ModernFurniture</li>
              <li>Electricity</li>
            </researchPrerequisites>
          </value>
        </li>

        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="EI_Aquarium"]/researchPrerequisites</xpath>
          <value>
            <researchPrerequisites>
              <li>MF_ModernFurniture</li>
              <li>Electricity</li>
            </researchPrerequisites>
          </value>
        </li>

        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[defName="EI_SoakingTubElectric"]/researchPrerequisites</xpath>
          <value>
            <researchPrerequisites>
              <li>MF_ModernFurniture</li>
              <li>Electricity</li>
            </researchPrerequisites>
          </value>
        </li>

      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
